{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56100","headline":"真人赞六首 五 · 杜光庭","name":"真人赞六首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"魂返入定质，神操从是荣。\n灭度如蜕胞，旷朗覩八清。\n转轮得神仙，由我改心精。\n受报无穷量，志定入福庭。\n七十二相好，皆从身中明。\n顶负七宝光，照耀诸天形。\n云迅八景舆，风回匡縁軿。\n昇入玄玄门，期乐乐未央。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}